cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use novelty-probe, please cite it as below."
title: "novelty-probe: a logged, AI-assisted workflow for probing the literature around a research idea"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Quan Yuan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/PadSama/novelty-probe-demo"
abstract: >-
  A tutorial workflow that breaks a research idea into facets, builds Boolean
  queries, searches OpenAlex and Semantic Scholar, merges and deduplicates the
  results, maps the top candidates to each facet of the idea, and verifies
  DOIs against Crossref. It collects evidence and does not judge novelty.
keywords:
  - literature search
  - research workflow
  - OpenAlex
  - Semantic Scholar
  - Crossref
  - science of science
license: MIT
